fixture tech11_toss_double_press
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "3 f startup"; docs/adr/0010: a press during the throw's startup is used up and does nothing
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 30
input
  0 R dash
  1 R toss
  2 R
  3 R toss
  4..29 R
end
expect
  at 1 event.toss=1
  # The second press lands in the startup: no teleport the moment the ember appears, and the dash
  # carries on.
  never 2..29 event.teleport=1
  at 4 ember=1 state=dash
end
